        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kanshi ici e cipimo ca mutuulo uyu uukankala uo muli nokulatuula. Pali homeri umo uwa ŋanu shenu ishasokolwa, muli nokulatuulapo akaputulwa kamo akalenga mutanda. Pali homeri umo uwa bale yenu iyatwiwa, muli nokulatuulapo akaputulwa kamo akalenga mutanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amafuta yakutuula ayakupimina mu bafa, yakaba cipimo capekumi ica mafuta ukufuma mu cipimo ca kori umo, umwingila babafa ikumi limo nangu ukulingana na homeri umo, pantu babafa ikumi limo eyalingana na homeri umo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku fitekwa fya bena Israeli, pa mpaanga imyanda ibili muli nokulatuulapo imo. Muli nokulaleta imituulo ya cabunga, ne mituulo ya fyakoca ne yakwampana, epakuti mulefuta pa fyabubifi fyenu. Efyasosa imfumu Yawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abantu bonse mu calo, bali nokulatwala uyo mutuulo ukankala kuli kateeka wa mu Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo uyo kateeka nao eukalaba no mulimo uwakumona palwa nama ishikalaba nokulaocewa pakushileka ilambo, eukalamona na palwa mituulo ya cabunga ne ya fyakunwa, ifikalatuulilwako uluko lonse ulwa bena Israeli, pa nshikunkulu shonse, na pa kusefya ukumoneka kwa mweshi upya onse, na pa nshiku shonse ishe Sabata. Kanshi uyo kateeka eukalamona palwa mituulo ya pa fyabubifi, na palwa mituulo ya cabunga, na palwa mituulo ya malambo ayakoca, na palwa mituulo yakwampana, e mituulo iyakufuta pa fibi fya ba ŋanda yakwa Israeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Imfumu Yawe alisosele ati, “Pa bushiku ubwakutampa umweshi wantanshi, muli nokulabuula umusepela umo uwa ŋombe ilume uwabula akalema, mukaleutuula ilambo ilyakusangulwilako icifulo camushilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa mulopa wa nama iyilekelwe ilambo palwa kubifya, shimapepo akalabuulapo umulopa umo, no kulaushinga ku maingwe ye tempele, na ku matungi yane ayaba pa mulu wa bulambo, na ku maingwe ya mpongolo ishakuiilapo mu lubansa lwa mwilinga lyamukati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efyo mukalecita na pa bushiku ubwalenga cine lubali ubwa uyo wine mweshi, ekufuta pa fyabubifi fya bantu bonse ifyo bashicitila ku mufulo nangu ifyo bacita mukukanaishiba. Efyo mukalasunga Itempele pakuti likaleba ilyamushilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa bushiku ubwalenga ikumi limo na shine (14) ubwa uyo wine mweshi wantanshi, elyo mukaletendeka ukulacindika Ipasaka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ipasaka:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lishiwi lya Cihibulu ilyalola mukutila “ukucilila,” moneni Ukufuma 12:13 kabili moneni mu mashiwi ya mu Baibele ku mpela.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", inshikunkulu ya Cakucilila. Bonse pa nshiku cine lubali bakalelyafye imikate iyishatutumuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa bushiku ubwakutampilapo inshikunkulu, kateeka ali nokulaleta cilume umo uwa ŋombe, no kulamutuula ilambo palwa kubifya kwakwe, na palwa kubifya kwa bantu bakwe bonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa nshiku shonse cine lubali isha nshikunkulu, kateeka ali nokulantuula ine ne Yawe Lesa bacilume wa ŋombe cine lubali ababula akalema, na basukusuku nabo cine lubali ababula akalema. Kabili pali isho shine nshiku, kateeka ali nokulatuula inshiku shonse sawe umo ngo mutuulo wakwelelwa pa bubifi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali cilume onse uwa ŋombe uo cilolo ali nokutuula ilambo, ali nokulalundapo icipimo ca efa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Efa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cipimo ca fintu ifishili fya menshi ifyafina amakilo ikumi limo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " umo uwabunga, na mafutapo aya miolifa nayo icipimo ca hini",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hini:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cipimo ca fya menshi menshi ifyalingana na balita bane.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " umo. Efyo ali nokulalunda na pali sukusuku onse uo ali nokulatuula ilambo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
